/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Who will get benefited by Palliative Care?  Any person who has a serious, complex, progressive or life-threatening illness or condition may benefit from palliative care, including children and young adults. As mentioned before, this also includes people who are expected to make a full recovery and those with lifelong or chronic conditions.)
/E (Who will get benefited by Palliative Care?  Any person who has a serious, complex, progressive or life-threatening illness or condition may benefit from palliative care, including children and young adults. As mentioned before, this also includes people who are expected to make a full recovery and those with lifelong or chronic conditions.)
